{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/Rhythm_Adventure00.png?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DODORI is a rhythm adventure game where you perform music along the lines of a rotating square. To create the ultimate performance, steady and passionate band practice is a must!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/Rhythm_Gif.gif?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/Narrative00.png?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are only six days left until the festival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And this year's festival feels different\u2014 Rumor has it a super famous band is coming to visit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But suddenly, your bandmates start handing in their resignation letters...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Sara, the vocalist of the Soun High School band, and it's up to you to bring the band back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/Move_Gif.gif?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/MiniGames00.png?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DODORI isn\u2019t a serious game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Right now, it's just a giant pudding(!), but many more fun and varied events are on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/Pudding_Gif.gif?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>At the heart of this game is always music\u2014</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>but maybe, just maybe, music isn't the most important thing after all.</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554970?t=1747477714","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/2fa09a871b91202b56612ed1fa43c17fce2496a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747477714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/a166e5cccf1a578d4db1c2673324deadd3c3b296/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747477714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/a166e5cccf1a578d4db1c2673324deadd3c3b296/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747477714","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/Rhythm_Adventure00.png?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DODORI is a rhythm adventure game where you perform music along the lines of a rotating square. To create the ultimate performance, steady and passionate band practice is a must!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/Rhythm_Gif.gif?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/Narrative00.png?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are only six days left until the festival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And this year's festival feels different\u2014 Rumor has it a super famous band is coming to visit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But suddenly, your bandmates start handing in their resignation letters...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Sara, the vocalist of the Soun High School band, and it's up to you to bring the band back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/Move_Gif.gif?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/MiniGames00.png?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DODORI isn\u2019t a serious game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Right now, it's just a giant pudding(!), but many more fun and varied events are on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/extras/Pudding_Gif.gif?t=1747477714\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>At the heart of this game is always music\u2014</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>but maybe, just maybe, music isn't the most important thing after all.</i></strong></p>","developers":["BridgeMusic"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2903240","name":"DODORI"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554970/24f72583e389547028cedd919b1d9bc8389ba06c/header.jpg?t=1747477714","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_